{"speciesId":370,"names":{"fr":"Lovdisc","es":"Luvdisc","en":"Luvdisc","ja":"ラブカス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LUVDISC live in shallow seas in the tropics. This heart-shaped POKéMON earned its name by swimming after loving couples it spotted in the ocean’s waves."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LUVDISC’s heart-shaped body is a symbol of love and romance. It is said that any couple meeting this POKéMON is promised a loving relationship that never ends."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"LUVDISC make the branches of CORSOLA their nests. There is a custom from long ago of giving a LUVDISC as a gift to express one’s feelings of love."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"During the spawning season, countless LUVDISC congregate at coral reefs, turning the waters pink."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"During the spawning season, countless LUVDISC congregate at coral reefs, turning the waters pink."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its heart-shaped body makes it popular. In some places, you would give a LUVDISC to someone you love."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its heart-shaped body makes it popular. In some places, you would give a LUVDISC to someone you love."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Un habitant des mers chaudes. On dit que le couple qui tombe sur ce Pokémon connaîtra l’amour éternel."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Un habitant des mers chaudes. On dit que le couple qui tombe sur ce Pokémon connaîtra l’amour éternel."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un habitant des mers chaudes. On dit que le couple qui tombe sur ce Pokémon connaîtra l’amour éternel."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en mares cálidos. Se dice que, si una pareja lo encuentra, será bendecida con amor eterno."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"暖かい 海に 生息する。 ラブカスを 見つけた カップルは 永遠の 愛が 続くという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Pendant la saison des amours, d’innombrables Lovdisc se réunissent près des barrières de corail et donnent l’impression que la mer est rose."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Durante el desove, multitud de Luvdisc se concentran en los arrecifes de coral coloreando de rosa el agua."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"During the spawning season, countless Luvdisc congregate at coral reefs, turning the waters pink."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"繁殖シーズンには たくさんの ラブカスが サンゴ礁に 集まり 海面が ピンク色に 染まる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Lovdisc vit dans les mers peu profondes des tropiques. Ce Pokémon en forme de cœur a gagné son nom en nageant derrière les couples d’amoureux qu’il repérait dans les eaux claires de l’océan."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Luvdisc vive en aguas tropicales poco profundas. Este Pokémon con forma de corazón se ha ganado la reputación que tiene por ir nadando detrás de las parejas de enamorados que veía entre las olas del océano."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Luvdisc live in shallow seas in the tropics. This heart-shaped Pokémon earned its name by swimming after loving couples it spotted in the ocean’s waves."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"熱帯の 浅い 海で 暮らしている。 カップルを 見つけると 後ろに くっついて 泳ぐ ことから この 名前が つけられた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le corps en forme de cœur de Lovdisc représente l’amour et les sentiments. On raconte qu’un couple qui rencontre ce Pokémon s’aimera jusqu’à la fin des temps."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Luvdisc tiene forma de corazón y simboliza el amor y el romanticismo. Dicen que la pareja que se encuentre con él mantendrá una relación de amor de por vida."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Luvdisc’s heart-shaped body is a symbol of love and romance. It is said that any couple meeting this Pokémon is promised a loving relationship that never ends."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ハート型の 体は 愛情の シンボル。 ラブカスに 出会った カップルは 永遠の 愛が 約束されると いわれているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Un Lovdisc esseulé perd tout entrain et baisse sa garde. Le Bekipan n’attend que cela pour frapper."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Cuando un Luvdisc se halla solo, su energía disminuye y baja la guardia, momento que aprovechan los Pelipper para hacerse con ellos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"If a Luvdisc is left on its own, it becomes despondent, leaving itself open to attack. That is when Pelipper snatch them up."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"１匹だけに なった ラブカスは 元気が なくなり スキだらけ。 そこを ペリッパーに さらわれる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Comme il est très populaire auprès des amoureux, les hôtels fréquentés par les couples en lune de miel en ont souvent dans leur piscine."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Es popular entre las parejas de enamorados, por lo que se suelen soltar en las piscinas de los hoteles donde se celebran lunas de miel."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Loving couples have a soft spot for this Pokémon, so honeymoon hotels often release this Pokémon into their pools."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"カップルに 人気が 高いので ハネムーン客が 泊まる ホテルの プールに 放流 される。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il fut un temps où les gens le capturaient en masse pour s’approprier ses écailles en forme de cœur, supposées porter chance en amour."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Según las leyendas, una escama con forma de corazón brinda suerte en el amor, lo que condujo tiempo ha a su pesca excesiva."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"There was an era when it was overfished due to the rumor that having one of its heart-shaped scales would enable you to find a sweetheart."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ハート型の ウロコを 持っていると 恋人が できると ウワサに なり 乱獲された 時代も あった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il vit dans les récifs coralliens des mers chaudes, et aime particulièrement dormir entre les cornes des Corayon."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Vive en los arrecifes de coral de mares cálidos. Dormir entre las ramas de los Corsola es algo por lo que siente una especial predilección."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Luvdisc makes its home in coral reefs in warm seas. It especially likes sleeping in the space between Corsola’s branches."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"暖かい 海の サンゴ礁が 棲み処。 サニーゴの枝の 間で 眠るのが 特に お気に入り。"}],"varieties":[{"id":370,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[1